    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The Things are living, metallic, geometric forms—such as cubes, globes, and tetrahedrons—that can combine into larger structures and wield destructive energy. They are sentient and controlled by Norhala in the hidden metal city. These entities serve the Metal Emperor and are capable of forming colossal shapes and using advanced weaponry.\n\n\\boxed{{living, metallic, geometric forms}}",
      "success": true,
