roject Gutenberg Literary\nArchive Foundation, how to help produce our new eBooks, and how to\nsubscribe to our email newsletter to hear about new eBooks.\n\n\nQuestion: What does \"In pace requiescat\" mean?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\"In pace requiescat\" is a Latin phrase meaning \"Rest in peace.\" It is traditionally used as a prayer for the deceased, expressing hope for their eternal peace. In \"The Cask of Amontillado,\" it serves as a chilling final remark after Fortunato’s entombment.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Rest in peace}}",
