    "prediction": "xiaomi/mimo-v2.5",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Holmes refused Watson's examination to prevent him from discovering the ruse, as he was not actually sick. The claim that the illness was highly infectious served as a convincing excuse to keep Watson at a distance. This ensured Watson remained unaware and could later testify as a witness to Smith's confession.\n\n\\boxed{To prevent Watson from discovering that he was feigning illness.}",
